{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日は｢音楽の日 ｣でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobqnkCkT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "\"The growing up train\"を披露させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご覧いただいた皆様ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobEnh80Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobTg9JYE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5thアニラの2着目に着ていた、メンバーもお気に入りの衣装💙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobuL1Z0G.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobfXDW84.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobYKG5D2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ダンス企画最高だったな〜！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "坂道グループ選抜チームのダンス最高だったーー！！\nめっちゃかっこよかったーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぎ、あいり、しづき！！ありがとう！